--- object @o "O" {\n  location [0m 0m 1m\n}\n
case.noll:2:12 error[null-syntax]: this [ is never closed; add ] after the last value
  fix: add ] after the last value
  `add ] after the last value` gives: object @o "O" {\n  location [0m 0m 1m]\n}\n
--- object @o "O" {\n  name = "x"\n}\n
case.noll:2:8 error[null-syntax]: `=` takes no spaces: write `name=…` on its owner's line, or `name …` as a line of its own
  fix: write `name` and its value as a line of its own
  `write `name` and its value as a line of its own` gives: object @o "O" {\n  name "x"\n}\n
